(3514170, 491959, 56057, '<td valign="top">DNMC 640x640<br/>This is soo good. :( It''s really a creative one (way to stick to the single body part) The editing looks wonderful and the angles are capturing. If anything- I would have changed the background color a bit, but only to seperate the hand from it. Great job!</td>', 'DNMC 640x640This is soo good. :( It''s really a creative one (way to stick to the single body part) The editing looks wonderful and the angles are capturing. If anything- I would have changed the background color a bit, but only to seperate the hand from it. Great job!', '2007-04-03 10:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
