(3535405, 492049, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I love the rich grungy processing and think this makes a really nice photo!<br/> <br/>Oh, and how it happens is that at rollover, the people''s votes who didn''t end up voting 20% get thrown out.   I''ve had mine go significantly up -- and I''ve had them go significantly down depending on who didn''t vote their 20%   If it''s the high scorers that didn''t finish voting it hurts.   But sometimes you get lucky and the low scorers get thrown out.  On my Free Study it jumped up aLOT!<br/> <br/>I would have voted this one very high!<br/></td>', 'I like it!  I love the rich grungy processing and think this makes a really nice photo! Oh, and how it happens is that at rollover, the people''s votes who didn''t end up voting 20% get thrown out.   I''ve had mine go significantly up -- and I''ve had them go significantly down depending on who didn''t vote their 20%   If it''s the high scorers that didn''t finish voting it hurts.   But sometimes you get lucky and the low scorers get thrown out.  On my Free Study it jumped up aLOT! I would have voted this one very high!', '2007-04-10 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3535409, 492140, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great photo!   You are so creative!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a great photo!   You are so creative! ', '2007-04-10 11:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
